          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: A witness contacted by email on GEIPAN regarding an observation of an object in the sky in Féchain on Friday, August 15, 2008, around 6:30 PM. He attaches three photographs but will produce no other documents to clarify his observation. No other testimony was collected on this phenomenon. This observation case is in every respect compatible with the observation of a balloon. Therefore, GEIPAN classifies it as B, a probable observation of a balloon, and not A, due to the inability to prove its exact origin.",
